That means: in the selected set, no chair has both neighbors also selected.  

Interpretation: We choose 8 chairs out of 16. Condition: No selected chair is adjacent to two selected chairs.  
Equivalently: In the selected pattern, we cannot have three consecutive chairs all selected.  
