[53/92] SuperGPQA/Agronomy The lactation yield of Shanghai cows is 12% higher than that of
We are told that the difference in lactation yield and butterfat content each involves about 10 pairs of genes (microallelic polygenic). That means each trait is controlled by 10 independently segregating loci, each with additive alleles.  

